From 9bbcc246488b1d24e13e580a75f935c5e458929c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:10:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Pack daily flake manifests and retain bounded
 terminal history

Proof: 40-row fixture drops comments from 40 to 3; 275 focused tests pass. Eight targeted mutants killed after adding an incomplete-run control. Preserve attempted-page bytes, FIFO retries and pending work. Expand nightly sibling pins and document installed hermes_cli dependency.
